00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:37.810
As I've said on the show since is April of
2017, the Mueller probe was never going to

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.930
remove Donald Trump, the 25th amendment.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:49.140
No matter how bad Trump gets, cognitively
will not be used to remove Donald Trump impeachment

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:54.260
or impingement as some of our, our, um, uh,
angry right-wing email or say impeachment

